<body>
  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <div class="container">

          <div class="header">
            <h1>Welcome to Puffin</h1>
            <p>Your email, your terms. Fast, local, and keyboard-first.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="body-content">
            <h2>Hi Bob,</h2>
            <p>Thanks for signing up for Puffin! You're now part of a growing
            community of power users who believe email should be fast, private,
            and controllable from the keyboard.</p>

            <p>Puffin is built around three core principles:</p>
            <ol>
              <li><strong>Zero lag</strong> — All your email is stored locally
              in SQLite. No waiting for a server response.</li>
              <li><strong>True offline-first</strong> — Your data is on your
              machine. IMAP syncs in the background.</li>
              <li><strong>No telemetry</strong> — We don't track you. Period.</li>
            </ol>

            <h2>Keyboard Shortcuts</h2>
            <p>Since you're a keyboard person, here are the essentials:</p>
            <table>
              <tr>
                <td>j / k</td>
                <td>Move selection down/up</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>o / Enter</td>
                <td>Open / Expand thread</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>c</td>
                <td>New draft</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Ctrl+P</td>
                <td>Open fuzzy search</td>
              </tr>
            </table>

            <h2>Next Steps</h2>
            <p>Here's what we recommend to get the most out of Puffin:</p>

            <div class="feature-grid">
              <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Set up IMAP</h3>
                <p>Add your email accounts in Settings to start syncing your messages locally.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Try the Composer</h3>
                <p>Hit <code>c</code> to write your first email. It supports Markdown with live preview.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Learn the shortcuts</h3>
                <p>Press <code>?</code> anytime to see the full list of keyboard shortcuts.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Import your data</h3>
                <p>Drag and drop .eml files or use the import tool to bring in your archive.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <p>
              <a href="https://puffin.app/getting-started" class="cta-button">
                Open Getting Started Guide
              </a>
            </p>

            <p>If you have any questions, just reply to this email. We're here to help!</p>

            <p>Best,<br><strong>The Puffin Team</strong></p>
          </div>

          <div class="footer">
            <p>
              Puffin is free and open source software.
              <br>
              <a href="https://puffin.app">puffin.app</a> &middot;
              <a href="https://github.com/puffin">GitHub</a>
            </p>
            <p>
              You received this email because you signed up for Puffin.
              <br>
              <a href="#">Unsubscribe</a>
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
